        "subject": "LU-20441 lnet: bump ip2nets/routes deprecation to 2.20",
        "message": "LU-20441 lnet: bump ip2nets/routes deprecation to 2.20\n\nThe ip2nets/routes deprecation was only added in commit\n2.16.61-44-g6b46e3fd8a, so it hasn't been in any LTS release We should\nmake ip2nets/routes deprecated, but available, in the next LTS.\n\nBump the deadline to 2.19.53 to give operators additional time to\nmigrate to DLC-based (YAML/netlink) configuration.\n\nFixes: 6b46e3fd8a (\"LU-19485 lnet: Deprecate ip2nets and routes params\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: Iba538d19f911ae2802083e5b06dd782b713834d3\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66998\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Serguei Smirnov <ssmirnov@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
